{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "044O", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-stacks}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b2d5955cf97ecb2ca4757155e955ac67d1f477dfed1683f859c6272b9bceb390", "source_text": "Quotient stacks", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8461b1f74469b01a5388303bee2dd301ac07d6a59f2a8f687c5f8266d2b2aa80", "unit_id": "tag:044O:title"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "044O", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$B$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0005": "$B$", "MATH_0006": "\\begin{equation}\n\\label{equation-quotient-stack}\n\\begin{matrix}\n(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}^{opp} &\n\\longrightarrow &\n\\textit{Groupoids} \\\\\nS' &\n\\longmapsto &\n(U(S'), R(S'), s, t, c)\n\\end{matrix}\n\\end{equation}", "MATH_0007": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n[U/_{\\!p}R] \\to (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}\n$$", "MATH_0009": "${}_p$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{section-quotient-sheaves}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{groupoids-section-quotient-sheaves}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{categories-example-functor-groupoids}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent", "STRUCT_0002": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0003": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a4d4a48df8ffebd0fc575d610ae2ff5462bee8b7158eb871ddbfe17b742bd4bc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:717ad5225c17dd6df98c597b0d1afb40b35da8c1f82868b81845e1d888d69d40", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section and the next few sections we describe a kind of\ngeneralization of\nSection <REF_0001>\nabove and\nGroupoids, Section <REF_0002>.\nIt is different in the following way:\nWe are going to take quotient stacks instead of quotient sheaves.\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\nLet us assume we have a scheme <MATH_0001>, and algebraic space <MATH_0002> over <MATH_0003>\nand a groupoid in algebraic spaces <MATH_0004> over <MATH_0005>. Given these data\nwe consider the functor\n<MATH_0006>\nBy\nCategories, Example <REF_0003>\nthis ``presheaf in groupoids'' corresponds to a category fibred in groupoids\nover <MATH_0007>. In this chapter we will denote\nthis\n<MATH_0008>\nwhere the subscript <MATH_0009> is there to distinguish from the quotient stack.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b637512794c1ecec310e2a13da8fb5a558f2e9ba8b6d70d36147bb455eb10bdb", "unit_id": "tag:044O:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "spaces-groupoids", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "044O", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$B \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0003": "$B$", "MATH_0004": "$$\np : [U/R] \\longrightarrow (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}\n$$", "MATH_0005": "$(U, R, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0006": "$[U/_{\\!p}R]$", "MATH_0007": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0008": "$(G, m)$", "MATH_0009": "$B$", "MATH_0010": "$a : G \\times_B X \\to X$", "MATH_0011": "$G$", "MATH_0012": "$B$", "MATH_0013": "$$\np : [X/G] \\longrightarrow (\\Sch/S)_{fppf}\n$$", "MATH_0014": "$(X, G \\times_B X, s, t, c)$", "MATH_0015": "$B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{stacks-lemma-stackify-groupoids}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{equation-quotient-stack}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-groupoid-from-action}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0002": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it ", "TEXTITOPEN_0002": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-quotient-stack}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:124d0e3369176263f7b89ea2080bc027b34777aeb8f10186eb548199251c959c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3824c29d2347ca2ee8db9b291294f862fb45e79df3abdf4b4cb2ccdac7ee984e", "source_text": "Quotient stacks. Let <MATH_0001> be as above.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Let <MATH_0002> be a groupoid in algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>.\nThe <TEXTITOPEN_0001>quotient stack<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0004>\nof <MATH_0005> is the stackification (see\nStacks, Lemma <REF_0001>)\nof the category fibred in groupoids <MATH_0006> over\n<MATH_0007> associated to\n(<REF_0002>).\n<STRUCT_0003> Let <MATH_0008> be a group algebraic space over <MATH_0009>.\nLet <MATH_0010> be an action of <MATH_0011> on an algebraic space\nover <MATH_0012>. The <TEXTITOPEN_0002>quotient stack<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\n<MATH_0013>\nis the quotient stack associated to the groupoid in algebraic spaces\n<MATH_0014> over <MATH_0015> of\nLemma <REF_0003>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6c058ee8470a569c32759404a99bf8a7f061300429ec40be0d08f8faad0b5c5e", "unit_id": "tag:044Q:statement"}
